      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Trim ends off Brussels sprouts. Quarter large ones and halve smaller ones. Place in a large bowl; drizzle with olive oil and mix well. Pour onto a rimmed baking sheet. Sprinkle with garlic powder and seasoned salt.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until tender, 30 to 45 minutes.",
